Vedam interface messages
Copyright 2026 ltbh.org

These files are the public application contract for Vedam. An application
may compile them and speak them to a Vedam node.

A Vedam-compatible node implements the contract as specified, including
defaults that protect subjects (encryption on, grant root in the account
owner, no ranking landlord, no fee required to exist). A fork that keeps
the names and drops those parts is not Vedam.
